<title>NETHERLANDS: KBB sees higher profits in current year.</title>
<headline>KBB sees higher profits in current year.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Department stores group Koninklijke Bijenkorf Beheer NV (KBB) said on Friday it expected net operating profit and earnings per share to rise in the current financial year, but declined to give an indication of the size of the rise.</p>
<p>The company earlier announced a drop in its final net profit from ordinary operations to 61.7 million guilders from 98.6 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
